The Unified Quality Dashboard in Grafana will be meticulously designed to serve the needs of various stakeholders, from individual developers to engineering leadership. It will be structured into logical sections, with each metric having a clear purpose and a defined target. The following table specifies the initial set of metrics to be implemented.

